<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{root}}assets/css/info-three-columns.css">
<section class="info-three-columns">
	<div class="inner">
		<h2 class="title">How Our Process Works</h2>
		<div class="info-three-columns__wrapper">
			<div class="info-three-columns__item">
				<div class="info-three-columns__heading">
					<img class="info-three-columns__img" src="{{root}}assets/images/process-icon-1.png" alt="">
					<h3 class="info-three-columns__h3">Comprehensive Property Valuation</h3>
				</div>
				<div class="info-three-columns__content" data-controls="read-more">
					<p class="info-three-columns__p">The Comprehensive Property Valuation is a completely non-obligatory
						step that involves the valuation of your property based on financial, market and demographic
						data.</p>
					<div class="read-more read-more_show">
						<button class="read-more__btn" type="button">
							Learn More {{svgInline "link-arrow.svg"}}</button>
					</div>
					<p class="info-three-columns__p">The Comprehensive Property Valuation is a completely non-obligatory
						step that involves the valuation of your property based on financial, market and demographic
						data.</p>
					<h4 class="info-three-columns__h4">This service includes:</h4>
					<ul class="info-three-columns__ul">
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Professional drone photography.</li>
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Rental unit competitor analysis.</li>
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Data assimilated for this valuation that is of serious
							material value (highly recommended regardless of whether you are considering selling your
							property or not).
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="info-three-columns__p color-blue">* This is a complimentary service in an attempt to win
						your business.</p>
					<p class="info-three-columns__p highlight">Should you choose to hire Hope Brothers to list your
						property, expect a closing within 4 to 6 months after the execution of a listing agreement.</p>
					<div class="read-more read-more_hide">
						<button class="read-more__btn" type="button">
							Back to top
							{{svgInline "link-arrow.svg"}}</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="info-three-columns__item">
				<div class="info-three-columns__heading">
					<img class="info-three-columns__img" src="{{root}}assets/images/process-icon-2.png" alt="">
					<h3 class="info-three-columns__h3">Hyper-Focused Marketing</h3>
				</div>
				<div class="info-three-columns__content" data-controls="read-more">
					<h4 class="info-three-columns__h4">Our process involves: </h4>
					<ul class="info-three-columns__ul">
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Direct emailing.</li>
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Posts on public and private real estate investment
							websites.
							<div class="read-more read-more_show">
								<button class="read-more__btn" type="button">
									Learn More {{svgInline "link-arrow.svg"}}</button>
							</div>
						</li>
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Targeted social media advertising.</li>
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Personal phone calls to buyers.</li>
					</ul>
					<h4 class="info-three-columns__h4">Takes place:</h4>
					<ul class="info-three-columns__ul">
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Over a period of 6 to 8 weeks after listing launch.</li>
					</ul>
					<h4 class="info-three-columns__h4">Will be seen by:</h4>
					<ul class="info-three-columns__ul">
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Tens of thousands of interested buyers - ranging from local
							husband and wife investor pairs to national real estate investment trusts.
						</li>
					</ul>
					<h4 class="info-three-columns__h4">Advantages:</h4>
					<ul class="info-three-columns__ul">
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">All of those receiving our marketing have alerted us to their
							interest in acquiring unit-based assets.
						</li>
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">The breadth of our marketing platform is only bound by the
							Atlantic and Pacific oceans. By casting such a wide net, Hope Brothers creates a
							concentrated competitive market for your listing.
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="info-three-columns__p highlight">It is rare to not have at least 3 to 5 qualified offers
						within the desired price range by the end of our marketing period.</p>
					<div class="read-more read-more_hide">
						<button class="read-more__btn" type="button">
							Back to top
							{{svgInline "link-arrow.svg"}}</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="info-three-columns__item">
				<div class="info-three-columns__heading">
					<img class="info-three-columns__img" src="{{root}}assets/images/process-icon-3.png" alt="">
					<h3 class="info-three-columns__h3">Shepherd of the Transaction</h3>
				</div>
				<div class="info-three-columns__content" data-controls="read-more">
					<p class="info-three-columns__p">We will be at your side during every decision point. From buyer
						selection through closing, we guarantee responsiveness, flexibility and professionalism. </p>
					<div class="read-more read-more_show">
						<button class="read-more__btn" type="button">
							Learn More {{svgInline "link-arrow.svg"}}</button>
					</div>
					<h4 class="info-three-columns__h4">Our number one priority in this phase:</h4>
					<ul class="info-three-columns__ul">
						<li class="info-three-columns__li">Maintaining the contracted value of your asset.</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="info-three-columns__p">This is achieved by bringing confidence to the buyer’s funding
						source(s) though our network of inspector, appraiser and lender relationships. </p>
					<p class="info-three-columns__p highlight">Ultimately, we are not compensated until your property is
						successfully sold.</p>
					<div class="read-more read-more_hide">
						<button class="read-more__btn" type="button">
							Back to top
							{{svgInline "link-arrow.svg"}}</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

